---
// BlogPost.astro maps the <script> element that Twitter's embed markup carries to this
// component. It used to inline a 99 KB copy of widgets.js; that broke the no-inline-
// scripts Content-Security-Policy, so the loader now comes from platform.twitter.com,
// which the policy in src/security/headers.ts allows.
---
<script is:inline async src="https://platform.twitter.com/widgets.js" charset="utf-8"></script>
